scenario.en:
Same code from the lesson:
<code>function add(x, y) {
  let result = x + y;
  return result;
}
add(3, 5);</code>
The arguments <code>3</code> and <code>5</code> are copied into add's frame as the parameters <code>x</code> and <code>y</code>. What single value does <code>return</code> place in the return register?

